WEBVTT

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:31.388
W qal, “Ɛla rkabikum.”

00:11:31.388 --> 00:11:34.188
W temmatik, had el-ɛesker el-metxunin

00:11:34.188 --> 00:11:36.821
b el-mzawed ntaɛhum w el-lebsa ntaɛ el-mḥamya,

00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:41.295
Rekɛu w huma yrejfu.

00:11:41.295 --> 00:11:47.380
Temmatik, ṭaḥ waḥed el-skat ygeṭṭeɛ.

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.938
W men beɛd waḥed el-zuj dqayeq,

00:11:49.938 --> 00:11:54.214
Tferktu gaɛ el-ġaši w kul waḥed raḥ l daru.

00:11:54.214 --> 00:11:59.696
Ḍerwek, ‘ana ɛendi: hadi hiya el-rzana f el-midan.

00:11:59.696 --> 00:12:03.862
F dak el-weqt, hadak weš dar.